          </t:listBibl>
          <t:note> The incipits and the explicits are taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/GCA837">Genoa, Castello d'Albertis, C.A. 837</t:ref>
           </t:note>

        <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="LukeGospelPreface">
          <t:label>Preface to the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
           <t:div type="textpart" subtype="subtextunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="SupplicationPrefaceLuke">
              <t:label>Supplication in the Preface to the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ። ዘመሓረነ፡ በረድኤቱ፡
               እምድኅረ፡ ስሕተት፡ ወዑረት። ወኣርኣየነ፡ ተመርሖ፡ እምድኅረ፡ እከይ፡ ወተኃጕሎት፡</t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወስብሓት፡ ሎቱ፡ ዕዘዝ፡ አልቦ፡ አምላክ፡ ዘእንበሌሁ።</t:ab></t:div>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="title expanded" xml:id="TitlePrefaceLuke"><t:ab>ንቀድም፡ በረድኤተ፡
             እግዚአብሔር፡ በጽሒፈ፡ መቅድመ፡ ሉቃስ፡ ኅሩይ፡ ፩፡ እም፸ወ፪፡ አርድእት፡ ኅሩያን።</t:ab></t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="subtextunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="BiographyLuke">
              <t:label>Biography of Luke</t:label>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>ዝንቱሰ፡ ሉቃስ፡ ነበረ፡ ዓቃቤ፡ ሥራይ፡ በኣንጾኪያ። ወኮነ፡ ረድኦ፡
               ለእግዚእነ። ወውእቱ፡ ቀለዮጳ፡ ዘተርእዮ፡ እግዚእነ፡ በፍኖተ፡ ኢማሑስ፡ በዕለተ፡ ትንሣኤ።</t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወኣዕረፈ፡ ከዊኖ፡ ሰማዕተ፡ በሮሜ፡ አመ፡ ፳ወ፪፡ ለጥቅምት።</t:ab></t:div>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="subtextunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="EusebianSectionsLuke">
              <t:label>Statement about the Eusebian Sections in the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>ወኍልቈ፡ ኣርእስቲሁ፡ ንኡሳን፡ ፫፻፡ ፵ወ፪።</t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወምዕራፋቲሁ፡ በልሳነ፡ ሮሜ፡ ፹፫።</t:ab></t:div>
            </t:div>
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="subtextunit" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TituliLuke">
              <t:label>Tituli of the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>፩፡ ጻሐፍት። ፪፡ ኖሎት። ፫፡ ስምዖን፡ ካህን።</t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>
              <t:l n="70">፹፩፡ ዘከመ፡ ነስሓ፡ ፈያታዊ።</t:l>
              <t:l n="71">፹፪፡ በእንተ፡ ስእለተ፡ ሥጋሁ።</t:l>
              <t:l n="72">፹፫፡ ቀለዮጳ፡ ወካልኡ።</t:l></t:ab></t:div>
            </t:div>
        </t:div>

        <t:div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2713Luke">
          <t:label>Bǝsrāta Luqās</t:label>
             <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="LukeGospelHeadline">
              <t:label>Headline of the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
              <t:ab><t:seg type="title inscriptio expanded">ብስራተ፡ አብ፡ ትሩፍ፡ ሉቃስ፡ ወንጌላዊ፡ አሓዱ፡
               እምሰብዓ፡ ወክልኤቱ፡ ኣርድእት።</t:seg> ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ የሀሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ገብሩ። <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="Abr"/>
               ወፍቁሩ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="Abr"/> ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</t:ab>
             </t:div>
             <t:div type="textpart" subtype="coretext" xml:id="LukeGospel">
               <t:label>Gospel of Luke</t:label>
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>እስመ፡ ብዙኃን፡ እለ፡ ፈቀዱ፡ ሠሪዓ፡ ዜና፡ ግብር፡ ዘንሕነ፡ ጠየቅናሁ፡ ዘከመ፡
                አይድዑነ፡ እልክቱ፡ እለ፡ ቀደሙ፡ ርእየቶ፡ ወተልእክዎ፡ ለቃል፡ ሊተኒ፡ ረትዓኒ፡ ካዕበ፡ ከመ፡ እጽሓፍ፡ ለከ፡</t:ab></t:div>
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>ወነበሩ፡ በቤተ፡ መቅደስ፡ እንዘ፡ ይሴብሕዎ፡ ወይባርክዎ፡
                ለእግዚአብሔር፡ በኵሉ፡ ጊዜ። አሜን።</t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch1">
                  <t:label>Chapter 1</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch2">
                  <t:label>Chapter 2</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch3">
                  <t:label>Chapter 3</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch4">
                  <t:label>Chapter 4</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch5">
                  <t:label>Chapter 5</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch6">
                  <t:label>Chapter 6</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch7">
                  <t:label>Chapter 7</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch8">
                  <t:label>Chapter 8</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch9">
                  <t:label>Chapter 9</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch10">
                  <t:label>Chapter 10</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch11">
                  <t:label>Chapter 11</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch12">
                  <t:label>Chapter 12</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch13">
                  <t:label>Chapter 13</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch14">
                  <t:label>Chapter 14</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch15">
                  <t:label>Chapter 15</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch16">
                  <t:label>Chapter 16</t:label>
               </t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="textsubunit" xml:id="ch17">
