            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="colophon" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="PostscriptLuke">
              <t:label>Colophon of the Gospel of Luke</t:label>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit"><t:ab>መልአ፡ ጽሕፈተ፡ <t:seg type="title subscriptio">ብስራቱ፡ ሉቃስ፡</t:seg></t:ab></t:div>
              <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit"><t:ab>በዓመተ፡ ፲ወ፬፡ እመንግሥተ፡ አቅላንድዮስ፡ ቄሳር። ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡
               ለቅዱስ፡ ሉቃስ፡ የሀሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ገብሩ፡ <t:gap reason="ellipsis" resp="Abr"/> ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን፡ ወአሜን።</t:ab></t:div>
            </t:div>
